  click UI_ONBOARD href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Onboarding/OnboardingCompleteView.swift#L161" "Onboarding's permission step. Anything other than authorized shows the denied screen." _blank
  click UI_SETTINGS href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/SettingsTabView.swift#L339" "Allow notifications button when notDetermined; Open system settings when denied; the status text otherwise." _blank
  click N_AUTH href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/NudgeNotificationService.swift#L95" "requestAuthorizationIfNeeded() asks only when authorizationState() is notDetermined, with options alert, badge, sound, providesAppNotificationSettings; authorized, provisional and ephemeral map to authorized; a thrown error maps to denied. No userNotificationCenter(_:openSettingsFor:) delegate method backs the providesAppNotificationSettings option." _blank
  click N_STATE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/NudgeNotificationService.swift#L80" "authorizationState() reads notificationSettings().authorizationStatus and never asks. Home calls only this (HomeTabView.swift:165); Settings and onboarding also call it to show the current status." _blank
  click UNC href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/unusernotificationcenter" "notificationSettings().authorizationStatus and requestAuthorization(options:). iOS gates delivery on this status for every add site." _blank
